{"strongs": "H7608", "word": "שְׁאֵר", "translit": "sha.a.rah", "root": "שאר", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "flesh", "definition": "שְׁאֵר noun masculine Ps 73:26 flesh (perhaps originally the inner flesh, full of blood, next the bones, compare Hoffm ZAW iii (1883), 107, and בָּשָׂר = (originally) flesh next the. skin); — ׳ שׁ absolute Ps 78:20 ; Ps 78:27 , construct Mic 3:3 +, suffix שְׁאֵרִי Jer 51:35 ; Ps 73:26 , etc; — 1. flesh : \\ \\ a. as food, Exod 21:10 ( HPS also 1Sam 9:24 , for הַנִּשְׁאָר ), Ps 78:20 (|| לֶחֶם ), v Ps 78:27 (|| עוֺף כָּנָף ); figurative Mic 3:2 (|| עוֺר ), v Mic 3:3 (|| id. ), Jer 51:35 (|| דָּם ), \\ \\ b. figurative for physical power Ps 73:26 (+ לֵבָב ), Prov 5:11 (+ בָּשָׂר ). 2. in HP = flesh- (= blood-) relation (i.e. one near of kin): שְׁאֵר אָבִיךָ Lev 18:12 compare v Lev 18:13 ; Lev 20:19 , also Lev 18:17 (read שְׁאֵרְךָ for שַׁאֲרָה ᵐ5 Ew Dr-Wh ; compare of. Di Baen ); + אֵלָיו הַקָּרֹב Lev 21:2 ; Num 27:11 בְשָׂרוֺ ׳ שׁ Lev 18:6 ; Lev 25:49 . 3. = self , Prov 11:17 (|| נֶפֶשׁ ),", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8386')\">BDB8386</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7607')\">H7607</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H7608')\">H7608</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8385')\">BDB8385</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8387')\">BDB8387</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁאֵר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ps 73:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,26)\">Ps 73:26</ref></sup> <highlightword>flesh</highlightword> (perhaps originally the inner flesh, full of blood, next the bones, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hoffm')\">Hoffm<sup>ZAW iii (1883), 107, and</sup></lookup> <bdbheb>בָּשָׂר</bdbheb> = (originally) flesh next the. skin); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"Ps 78:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,20)\">Ps 78:20</